# --- Added during pre-production audit (2026-08-22) ---

# Kotlin incremental compilation state
/.kotlin

# Release artifacts stay archived on disk, not in git: an AAB is ~9 MB and its
# mapping.txt another ~40 MB, per release.
/Releases

# Pre-audit source snapshot. Safe to delete once the git history below is
# trusted; kept out of the repo either way.
/_backup_pre_audit_*

# Debugging leftovers - logcat dumps and repro screenshots.
#
# *.logcat is deliberately unanchored (a dump saved in a subdirectory counts too),
# but /*.png is deliberately anchored to the ROOT and must stay that way: the ~20
# gs*/repro*/stations*/fix* screenshots live there, while design/*.png, the launcher
# icons under app/src/main/res/, and any future docs/screenshots/ are all things we
# DO want tracked. Dropping the leading slash would silently swallow every one of them.
*.logcat
/*.png

# Local-only Claude Code settings. Deliberately narrow rather than ignoring
# .claude/ wholesale, so a shared CLAUDE.md or team settings.json can be
# committed later without fighting this file.
/.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Added when the project went open-source (2026-09-08) ---

# Signing material. NONE of this has ever been in the repo and the .jks lives in
# Google Drive - these lines exist so a stray copy in the project directory cannot
# be committed by an absent-minded `git add .`. On a public repo a pushed signing
# key is a published signing key, and no later .gitignore edit can un-publish it.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pepk
keystore.properties
signing.properties
secrets.properties

# IDE state: ALLOWLIST, not denylist.
#
# This used to enumerate the handful of Studio files known to carry local state
# (deploymentTargetSelector, deviceManager, studiobot). That fails open - every
# file a future Studio version invents lands in git by default, and several of
# them embed local AVD paths or per-machine test-run state. Inverting it means an
# unrecognised .idea file is ignored until someone deliberately un-ignores it.
#
# /.idea/* and NOT /.idea/** - git never descends into a directory excluded by **,
# which would make every negation below dead. The entries listed here are exactly
# the nine files already tracked; project config that is genuinely shared (JDK
# level, bytecode target, inspection profile) stays in, machine state stays out.
/.idea/*
!/.idea/.gitignore
!/.idea/.name
!/.idea/AndroidProjectSystem.xml
!/.idea/compiler.xml
!/.idea/gradle.xml
!/.idea/misc.xml
!/.idea/runConfigurations.xml
!/.idea/vcs.xml
!/.idea/inspectionProfiles/

# OS and editor cruft, for contributors who are not on this machine.
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Studio profiler dumps (heap/CPU), which land at the project root, and build
# outputs that reached somewhere other than app/build/ or Releases/.
*.hprof
*.trace
*.aab
*.apk
